{
  "name": "Vantyse - Traitement rapports intervention (societes de nettoyage)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "SMOKE TEST\n\nInput attendu : email envoye a la boite dediee rapports@ avec 1 piece jointe photo/PDF d'un rapport d'intervention (ex: mock-data/input-sample.json -> champ raw_image_description simule la photo recue).\n\nOutput attendu : mock-data/output-sample.json (JSON structure avec site, date_intervention, agent, duree_heures, statut='ok') + 1 ligne ajoutee dans Google Sheets + 1 fichier archive dans Google Drive.\n\nCe workflow n'a pas ete teste dans une instance n8n reelle (squelette de bibliotheque). A valider a l'import avant mise en production.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 380
      },
      "id": "note-smoke-test",
      "name": "Note - Smoke test",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-200, -300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": { "item": [{ "mode": "everyMinute" }] },
        "simple": false,
        "filters": { "q": "has:attachment" }
      },
      "id": "gmail-trigger",
      "name": "1. Reception rapport (Gmail Trigger)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmailTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 0],
      "credentials": { "gmailOAuth2": { "id": "REPLACE_ME", "name": "Gmail - boite rapports" } }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "boolean": [{ "value1": "={{ $binary.attachment_0 !== undefined }}", "value2": true }]
        }
      },
      "id": "if-has-attachment",
      "name": "2. IF piece jointe presente",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [220, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": { "operation": "binaryToPropery", "binaryPropertyName": "attachment_0" },
      "id": "extract-image-base64",
      "name": "3. Conversion image/PDF en base64",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.extractFromFile",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [440, -80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "image",
        "operation": "analyze",
        "modelId": "gpt-4o-mini",
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "Tu extrais les informations d'un rapport d'intervention de nettoyage depuis la photo ou le PDF fourni (feuille manuscrite ou formulaire). Reponds UNIQUEMENT en JSON valide avec les champs: site_nom, site_adresse (si visible), date_intervention (YYYY-MM-DD), agent_nom, heure_debut, heure_fin, duree_heures, taches_realisees (tableau), anomalie_signalee (booleen), anomalie_description (chaine vide si aucune)."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "openai-extraction",
      "name": "4. Extraction structuree (OpenAI gpt-4o-mini vision)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [660, -80],
      "credentials": { "openAiApi": { "id": "REPLACE_ME", "name": "OpenAI - Vantyse" } }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "functionCode": "const f = JSON.parse($json.message.content);\nconst siteConnu = !!(f.site_nom && f.site_nom.trim().length > 0);\nconst dateValide = !!(f.date_intervention && /^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$/.test(f.date_intervention));\nf.champs_valides = siteConnu && dateValide;\nf.statut = f.champs_valides ? 'ok' : 'a_verifier';\nreturn [{ json: f }];"
      },
      "id": "validate-fields",
      "name": "5. Controle champs obligatoires",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.function",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [880, -80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": { "boolean": [{ "value1": "={{ $json.champs_valides }}", "value2": true }] }
      },
      "id": "if-fields-valid",
      "name": "6. IF champs valides",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1100, -80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "sheetId": "={{ $env.GOOGLE_SHEET_ID }}",
        "range": "Registre!A:H"
      },
      "id": "sheets-append",
      "name": "7a. Enregistrement registre (Google Sheets)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1320, -160],
      "credentials": { "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": { "id": "REPLACE_ME", "name": "Google Sheets - Vantyse" } }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "upload",
        "folderId": "={{ $env.GOOGLE_DRIVE_FOLDER_ID }}",
        "fileName": "={{ $json.site_nom }}_{{ $json.date_intervention }}.jpg"
      },
      "id": "drive-archive",
      "name": "8. Archivage photo/PDF (Google Drive)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1540, -160],
      "credentials": { "googleDriveOAuth2Api": { "id": "REPLACE_ME", "name": "Google Drive - Vantyse" } }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "boolean": [{ "value1": "={{ $json.anomalie_signalee }}", "value2": true }]
        }
      },
      "id": "if-anomalie",
      "name": "9. IF anomalie signalee",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1760, -160]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "automatisation@nettoyage-client.fr",
        "toEmail": "={{ $env.EMAIL_ALERTE_ANOMALIE }}",
        "subject": "Anomalie signalee sur site - a traiter",
        "text": "=Le rapport du site {{ $json.site_nom }} du {{ $json.date_intervention }} signale une anomalie : {{ $json.anomalie_description }}. Merci de planifier une action."
      },
      "id": "email-anomalie",
      "name": "9a. Alerte anomalie dirigeant",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1980, -240]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "automatisation@nettoyage-client.fr",
        "toEmail": "={{ $env.EMAIL_ALERTE_ANOMALIE }}",
        "subject": "Rapport d'intervention a verifier manuellement",
        "text": "=Un rapport recu ne permet pas d'identifier automatiquement le site ou la date. Merci de verifier manuellement (piece jointe conservee dans la boite rapports)."
      },
      "id": "email-a-verifier",
      "name": "6b. Alerte rapport a verifier",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1100, 120]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "automatisation@nettoyage-client.fr",
        "toEmail": "={{ $env.EMAIL_RAPPORT_NON_TRAITE }}",
        "subject": "Email recu sans photo/PDF exploitable",
        "text": "Un email a ete recu dans la boite rapports sans piece jointe exploitable. A verifier manuellement."
      },
      "id": "email-sans-pj",
      "name": "2b. Notification absence piece jointe",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [440, 120]
    },
    {
      "parameters": { "rule": { "interval": [{ "field": "cronExpression", "expression": "0 17 * * 5" }] } },
      "id": "cron-hebdo",
      "name": "10. Cron hebdomadaire (vendredi 17h)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.cron",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "read",
        "sheetId": "={{ $env.GOOGLE_SHEET_ID }}",
        "range": "Registre!A:H"
      },
      "id": "sheets-read-recap",
      "name": "11. Lecture registre semaine",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [220, 400],
      "credentials": { "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": { "id": "REPLACE_ME", "name": "Google Sheets - Vantyse" } }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "functionCode": "const rows = $input.all().map(i => i.json);\nconst parSite = {};\nfor (const r of rows) {\n  parSite[r.site_nom] = parSite[r.site_nom] || { sites: r.site_nom, heures: 0, anomalies: 0 };\n  parSite[r.site_nom].heures += Number(r.duree_heures || 0);\n  if (r.anomalie_signalee) parSite[r.site_nom].anomalies += 1;\n}\nreturn [{ json: { nb_sites: Object.keys(parSite).length, nb_rapports: rows.length, detail: Object.values(parSite) } }];"
      },
      "id": "aggregate-recap",
      "name": "12. Agregation par site/contrat",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.function",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [440, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "automatisation@nettoyage-client.fr",
        "toEmail": "={{ $env.EMAIL_RECAP_HEBDO }}",
        "subject": "Recap hebdomadaire - rapports d'intervention traites",
        "text": "=Recapitulatif de la semaine : {{ $json.nb_rapports }} rapports traites sur {{ $json.nb_sites }} sites. Base pre-remplie pour la facturation du mois. Voir le registre complet pour le detail."
      },
      "id": "email-recap",
      "name": "13. Envoi recap dirigeant",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [660, 400]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "1. Reception rapport (Gmail Trigger)": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "2. IF piece jointe presente", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "2. IF piece jointe presente": {
